      "statement": "Aspire starts the API only after the PostgreSQL catalog database is ready (WaitFor(catalogDb)) and exposes the API liveness check at /alive via WithHttpHealthCheck; the AppHost also forces the API into the Development environment so user-secrets load and startup migrations stay enabled, and pins the API to fixed host port 5192.",
